window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>Kill or be killed.</b></p> <p>That’s the rule when traveling through Hell.</p> <p>It may sound exciting to ride through Hell to save one of your lovers, but in reality it’s full of blood and magic, orcs and Hellhounds, secrets and revelations.</p> <p>The Wraith King’s minions will do anything to capture or kill me. But I’ve got a plan to strike back. To do it, I just need to keep my own growing urge to kill under control.</p>"; 
